+On Linux, switching from the supervisor to an explicit numeric workload UID
+clears supplementary groups before changing UID. Numeric identities do not
+inherit the supervisor's groups or acquire groups by matching a named account.
+Failure to clear groups aborts the spawn. Named policy users retain their
